  "description": "A .NET 10 redistribution of the Noto Music font, packaged for the CodeBrix family. Ships the single Noto Music static font (upstream publishes one Regular face) covering the Unicode music blocks — Western musical symbols, Byzantine musical symbols and ancient Greek musical notation — plus a font .ttf.manifest JSON. Intended as a music-notation companion font alongside the family's text font packages. The whole package, code and font alike, is distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.",
